ships  uh  there's a politics to it what does that  mean it means that you you have to  persuade  coerce encourage people to do things  they wouldn't otherwise do  and lincoln lincoln was a master at that  he was a master that for two reasons he  had learned through his hard life to  read people  to anticipate them to spend a lot of  time listening one thing i often tell  people is the best leaders or the  listeners not the talkers  and then second um lincoln was very  thoughtful and planned  every move out he was thinking three or  four moves maybe five moves down the  chess board  while others were move number one or two  that's fascinating to think  about him just listening to studying  that's uh you know  they they look at great fighters in this  way like the first few rounds of boxing  and mixed martial arts you're studying  the movement of your opponent  in order to sort of uh to find the holes  that's that's a really interesting frame  to think about it  you

